                                "sense_id": "0efaa022-954b-3966-91ab-320ee0a4f94f",
                                "text": "“An organization’s reputational integrity is its greatest currency. When you compromise that, you have lost the loyalty and trust of your employees,” Wahler said. “His approach is going to increase inefficiency by creating an environment marked by instability, a lack of trust and divisiveness.”"
